{"id":"617048","name":"腊肠糯米饭","author":"斌joanliu","authorId":"11138610","desc":"","cover":"images/617048/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"糯米","amount":"2杯"},{"name":"清水","amount":"1杯"},{"name":"盐","amount":"少许"}],"sub":[{"name":"麻辣香肠","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1根"},{"name":"小包菜","amount":"1个"},{"name":"姜蒜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"糯米昨晚先泡一晚上，放点点盐。早上沥干水，两杯米一杯水的比例再放清水煮好。用饭勺打散冷却。","img":"images/617048/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"胡萝卜切片。","img":"images/617048/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"包菜切小片。","img":"images/617048/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅预热，放油，放姜蒜。","img":"images/617048/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入胡萝卜，炒两分钟。","img":"images/617048/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"再放入包菜，炒两分钟。放盐和生抽，炒匀。","img":"images/617048/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入糯米饭。","img":"images/617048/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"翻炒均匀。","img":"images/617048/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入蒸好的切片的麻辣香肠，继续炒均匀。","img":"images/617048/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"起点锅巴好吃。","img":"images/617048/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"小火再炒炒。","img":"images/617048/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"出锅，香。","img":"images/617048/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}